{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/9ec6e02b034cd8ab0f529598a50eaa74.poster.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/9ec6e02b034cd8ab0f529598a50eaa74.webm?t=1771575393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/4eff358b9cde4bfa48f4904543f8c01e.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kind-hearted succubus, Remuria, an outlier among the succubi, won't kill her prey and cannot ignore injustice. One day, she helps Ariandelle, a half-elf slave, escape captivity. However, Remuria soon discovers that her own village is also in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaming up with Ariandelle, the two set out on a journey with shared goals: to free all the enslaved elves, defend the succubi village, and uncover their enemy's ultimate goal. But that's not the end of their struggle, as Ariandelle is afflicted with Soul Crusher\u2014a powerful mental spell that only Remuria can temporarily alleviate with her special powers. To break the spell completely, they must track down the caster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/6221b5756ad06bb65570168ee11ab6e7.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in two separate modes. Enjoy the story in Novel Mode, where you follow the plot and get to know the characters. In RPG Mode you can explore, fight enemies, and work to push the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies first to gain the upper hand with a preemptive strike, giving you an advantage in turn-based battles. Plan ahead to use your resources carefully to overcome tough challenges and keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/363e5c4692328bd3e5cf16b0a92b748e.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/1602e33aca16b0157265de0258715258.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/8e52b9953ed790fc3db9b656dc02c909.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/bbf7b374ce91686383c2789045b48aa4.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/a92e7af2c29e915014aa2ba83973f7d5.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Animated H-Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a hot collection of beautifully animated scenes to enhance your viewing pleasure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recollection Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is lost in the story! Every unlocked scene can be revisited and watched again through the Recollection Room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Novel Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you can enjoy all scenes with a traditional Visual Novel interface and its features, including LOG, SAVE, and HIDE Window.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merciful Second Chances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you lose a battle, you can continue playing with 1 HP. If you're out of resources, the game allows you to restart from the beginning of the map with your resources rolled back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save Anywhere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to save anytime you want, so don\u2019t worry about losing your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Dark Age","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/13072655e9475640363a067d335475a18a36df37.jpg"},{"name":"Save Ariandelle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/b52aeafdf001b2b71a543cfb1141299bfa13f208.jpg"},{"name":"Rem & Aria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/0f4949a798d7c2d215139c667ed8f9d5c126309f.jpg"},{"name":"Mother Lilim\u2019s Blessing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/3d17e9c944a71df3418cb07b69500cf0de13faf5.jpg"},{"name":"Declaration of War","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/2f4c2d09603559a06b0d368cb43193e90be58654.jpg"},{"name":"Ariandelle\u2019s Bloodline","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/06968129aa98ccb2fe4d820f410a47d1bc476d89.jpg"},{"name":"The Memories of Atreus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/448cc5ececd9d22433573485159e6fd78728b164.jpg"},{"name":"Black Fang\u2019s Assault","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/44bed168eb07d6bcca2e30ac05cef3c44342736b.jpg"},{"name":"Lilith\u2019s Ring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/78b3d898b744461b0d788b56c80eb074fb9d5cfa.jpg"},{"name":"Our New Journey","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3606750/72323cc131bf25a5353e11e5b3d2b72e47dfb145.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3606750?t=1771575393","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/14ffe91904d916434306f5386334b5d37d1b2697/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771575393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/c3ba1b6757fbf7644f2405007d8e7cddfee4b68e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771575393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/c3ba1b6757fbf7644f2405007d8e7cddfee4b68e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771575393","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game contains mosaic censorship, explicit nudity, sexual relationships between adults, non-consensual sex, and drug/alcohol abuse."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/9ec6e02b034cd8ab0f529598a50eaa74.poster.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/9ec6e02b034cd8ab0f529598a50eaa74.webm?t=1771575393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/4eff358b9cde4bfa48f4904543f8c01e.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A kind-hearted succubus, Remuria, an outlier among the succubi, won't kill her prey and cannot ignore injustice. One day, she helps Ariandelle, a half-elf slave, escape captivity. However, Remuria soon discovers that her own village is also in danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teaming up with Ariandelle, the two set out on a journey with shared goals: to free all the enslaved elves, defend the succubi village, and uncover their enemy's ultimate goal. But that's not the end of their struggle, as Ariandelle is afflicted with Soul Crusher\u2014a powerful mental spell that only Remuria can temporarily alleviate with her special powers. To break the spell completely, they must track down the caster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/6221b5756ad06bb65570168ee11ab6e7.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the game in two separate modes. Enjoy the story in Novel Mode, where you follow the plot and get to know the characters. In RPG Mode you can explore, fight enemies, and work to push the story forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack enemies first to gain the upper hand with a preemptive strike, giving you an advantage in turn-based battles. Plan ahead to use your resources carefully to overcome tough challenges and keep moving forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/363e5c4692328bd3e5cf16b0a92b748e.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/1602e33aca16b0157265de0258715258.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/8e52b9953ed790fc3db9b656dc02c909.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/bbf7b374ce91686383c2789045b48aa4.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/extras/a92e7af2c29e915014aa2ba83973f7d5.avif?t=1771575393\" width=616 height=110 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Animated H-Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a hot collection of beautifully animated scenes to enhance your viewing pleasure!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recollection Room</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is lost in the story! Every unlocked scene can be revisited and watched again through the Recollection Room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Novel Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you can enjoy all scenes with a traditional Visual Novel interface and its features, including LOG, SAVE, and HIDE Window.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Merciful Second Chances</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you lose a battle, you can continue playing with 1 HP. If you're out of resources, the game allows you to restart from the beginning of the map with your resources rolled back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save Anywhere</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to save anytime you want, so don\u2019t worry about losing your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Fantasy Land"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606750/18c1648a42b8b7bfca2896db1d6de348ee614d93/header.jpg?t=1771575393","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3606750/1672954536/88cf337f934b7b5ef7e8e148c6277196c758abc2/1756924406/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761306870","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3606750/1672954536/88cf337f934b7b5ef7e8e148c6277196c758abc2/1756924406/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761306870","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3606750/1672954536/88cf337f934b7b5ef7e8e148c6277196c758abc2/1756924406/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761306870","id":257192774,"name":"EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192774/1de8af8923693ecf1d3ce27d4a8f134a37b54bc1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761306870"}],"name":"Succubus Crisis","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Succubus Crisis - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99</span> $7.99 USD","packageid":1271937,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-20% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":799}],"title":"Buy Succubus Crisis"}],"packages":[1271937],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong